        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers ? We Get The Pick Of The Crop\n\nThis beautiful 5-bedroom residence enjoys a magnificently private site in Rath Gailine, one of Portlaoise?s most prestigious residential addresses, and now with the opening of the footpath to the Dublin Road, it is now one of the town?s most convenient addresses too.\n\nWith 5 bedrooms and three bathrooms including a ground floor ensuite bedroom, this is an excellent family home.\n\nOozing exceptional kerb appeal, this stunning brick fronted property affords timeless charm in a peaceful setting. There is excellent off-street parking and the attractive font garden sets the property nicely back from the street.\n\nA recently added composite front door announces a home that has been greatly cared for.\n\nThe ground floor offers bright, spacious and beautifully presented accommodation throughout. An inviting entrance hall leads to a generous sitting room featuring stylish herringbone flooring, a feature fireplace and glazed double doors opening into the impressive kitchen and dining area. \n\nThis superb family space is fitted with an excellent range of bespoke units and provides ample room for a large dining table, while patio doors flood the room with natural light and open directly onto the rear garden. There is a practical utility room off the kitchen.\n\n A separate second reception room is ideal as a playroom, home office or family room, with an ensuite off this room, it can easily double as a fifth bedroom. \n\nUpstairs, a bright landing leads to four well-proportioned bedrooms, providing excellent accommodation for a growing family. The spacious principal bedroom features an extensive range of fitted wardrobes and the added privacy of its own ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms are bright and versatile, equally suitable for children, guests or a home office. A well-appointed family bathroom, completes the accommodation.\n\nBuilt by Kelly builders, Rath Gailine is a prestigious residential development with excellent green space and is superbly quiet being tucked away in a beautiful location on the Dublin Road.\n Schools shops, hospital and town centre are all within walking distance. 1GB broadband is laid on.\n\nWith the opening of a private walkway through Rath Rua due in recent weeks, this property now has pedestrian access to Portlaoise Hospital and the new Portlaoise Bus Service, giving round the clock transport to Train Station, Town Centre and more Schools.\n\nViewing of this beautiful home is highly recommended.\n\nFULL FLOOR PLAN AND VIRTUAL TOUR TO FOLLOW"
